<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "When topic lock is set, only channel operators can change the topic."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "When to use it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "The topic is the line shown above the messages of a channel. Everyone who joins reads it first. Lock it when the topic carries rules, links or an announcement that should not be edited by any member."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Usage")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/mode +t  {dgettext("help_channels", "Enable topic lock")}
/mode -t  {dgettext("help_channels", "Disable topic lock")}</pre>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "The command changes the channel you are looking at. You do not type the channel name."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "How it works")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Without the lock, any member of the channel can set a new topic with %{command}.",
      command: "/topic"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "With the lock, only owners and operators can change it. Half-operators, voiced users and regular members get an error."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Anyone in the channel can still read the topic. The command with no text shows it:"
    )} <code>/topic</code>
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_general}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Channel Central")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Topic Lock and choose Apply Modes."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Rules and limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Only channel operators and owners can turn the lock on or off.")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "A new channel starts without the lock. In a registered channel the lock and the topic are saved and come back after a restart."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_channels", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p><.help_link topic="cmd-topic">{dgettext("help_channels", "/topic Command")}</.help_link></p>
